What are we looking for?
• You have relevant work experience;
• You are flexibly available for +/- three days per week;
• You have humor, boundless energy, and can work independently;
• You are a star at communicating and can finish work perfectly;
• You have an eye for detail and are always looking to improve things;
• You speak English fluently and preferably Dutch. 
